          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Trier et filtrer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Spatial": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Spatial"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Spatial depth would be lost.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La profondeur spatiale serait perdue."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Starting…": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Démarrage…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stop": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Arrêter"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stop compressing?": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Arrêter la compression ?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stopped": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Arrêté"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Système"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The new file didn't match the original, so it was discarded.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le nouveau fichier ne correspondait pas à l’original, il a donc été jeté."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The original couldn't be loaded.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L’original n’a pas pu être chargé."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The original couldn't be read.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L’original n’a pas pu être lu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The originals are in Recently Deleted, where iOS keeps them for 30 days. Empty it in Photos to get the space back now.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les originaux sont dans « Suppressions récentes », où iOS les garde 30 jours. Videz-le dans Photos pour récupérer l’espace tout de suite."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The slow-motion ramp couldn't be edited anymore.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La rampe du ralenti ne pourrait plus être modifiée."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Their copies are in your library. Removing them gives back %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Leurs copies sont dans votre photothèque. Les supprimer libère %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This device can't encode that format.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cet appareil ne peut pas encoder ce format."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This file format isn't supported.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce format de fichier n’est pas pris en charge."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This item can't be changed from apps.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cet élément ne peut pas être modifié par les apps."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To free": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "À libérer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unsupported": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Non pris en charge"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Video": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vidéo"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Video quality": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qualité vidéo"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Videos": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vidéos"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Videos are encoded in HEVC. HDR stays HDR, audio is kept as is. Long videos can take a while: the run keeps going if you leave the app.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les vidéos sont encodées en HEVC. Le HDR reste HDR, l’audio est gardé tel quel. Les longues vidéos peuvent prendre du temps : la compression continue si vous quittez l’app."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for free space": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "En attente d’espace libre"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What's Kept": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce qui est conservé"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Working through photos…": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Traitement des photos…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Writing failed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L’écriture a échoué."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Yellow": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jaune"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your iPhone is almost full": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Votre iPhone est presque plein"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iOS asks you before any original is deleted.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iOS vous demande avant de supprimer un original."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iOS doesn't let apps set the date a photo was added, or read captions. Copies appear where they belong when Photos is sorted by Date Captured, and at the top when sorted by Recently Added.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iOS ne permet pas aux apps de définir la date d’ajout d’une photo, ni de lire les légendes. Les copies apparaissent à leur place quand Photos est trié par date de capture, et en haut quand il est trié par ajout récent."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iOS will ask you first. Originals then go to Recently Deleted for 30 days.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iOS vous demandera d’abord. Les originaux vont ensuite dans « Suppressions récentes » pendant 30 jours."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "of %lld selected": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "sélectionnés sur %lld"
          }
        }
      }
    },
